  #line-at(70.824pt, 110.18pt, "For better resolution, it is necessary to use faster detectors or to divide the measurements into ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 124.7pt, "several channels. Such multichannel variant is not a problem for the remote analysis of the ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 139.22pt, "entanglement photon pairs, where the interacted arm works just as a fast trigger. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 370.97pt, "Fig. 6. Remote detection of reflection coefficients changes by entanglement photon pairs during ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 385.61pt, "ultrashort laser surface interaction: dashed lines - approximation of reflection coefficients from ")
